<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  rk6.urdf : rk6.urdf.xacro dosyasinin xacro ile genisletilmis duz URDF kopyasi (Fusion kolu).
  SADECE REFERANS: Launch dosyalari HER ZAMAN rk6.urdf.xacro kullanir. Buradaki gz_ros2_control
  <parameters> yolu yer tutucudur (rk6_controllers.yaml); Gazebo icin xacro surumunu kullanin.
  Mesh yollari package://rk6_description/meshes/... (paket kurulu olmali).
  Yeniden uretmek icin (WSL, ~/rt_ws derlendikten sonra):
    xacro $(ros2 pkg prefix rk6_description)/share/rk6_description/urdf/rk6.urdf.xacro controllers_file:=rk6_controllers.yaml
-->
<!-- =================================================================================== -->
<!-- |    This document was autogenerated by xacro from ~/rt_ws/install/rk6_description/share/rk6_description/urdf/rk6.urdf.xacro | -->
<!-- |    EDITING THIS FILE BY HAND IS NOT RECOMMENDED                                 | -->
<!-- =================================================================================== -->
<!--
  rk6: ogrencinin gercek kolu (Fusion 360 export). Ana Xacro dosyasi.
  Kaynak: Fusion entegrasyon araclari (eklemler: kinematics_spec.json; mesh'ler: mesh_groups.json + mesh_birlestir.py; depoya dahil degil).

  ===================== URDF KURALI =====================
  Sifir pozda (q = 0) kol dimdik yukari bakar ve TUM link cerceveleri base_link ile paraleldir (rpy = 0).
  Eklem eksenleri: J1, J4, J6 = z ; J2, J3, J5 = y. Pozitif q2/q3/q5 kolu +x (one) eger.
  base_link: J1 ekseni uzerinde, taban plakasinin ALT yuzeyi (= zemin, world z = 0). x = kolun one uzandigi yon
             (CAD'de iki on ayagin arasi; ayaklar simulasyonda yok), z yukari.
  tool0: parmak ic yuzeylerinin (pad) ortasi, J6 ekseni uzerinde. z = yaklasma, y = parmak acilma yonu.

     joint  | parent    | child  | origin xyz [m]            | axis
     joint1 | base_link | link1  | 0   0        0.0547       | 0 0 1
     joint2 | link1     | link2  | 0  -0.0308   0.0766       | 0 1 0
     joint3 | link2     | link3  | 0   0.0509   0.22995      | 0 1 0
     joint4 | link3     | link4  | 0   0.0451   0.0508       | 0 0 1
     joint5 | link4     | link5  | 0  -0.0309   0.17915      | 0 1 0
     joint6 | link5     | link6  | 0  -0.0351   0.0508       | 0 0 1
     tool0_joint (fixed) link6 -> tool0 : xyz 0 0 0.15013

  ===================== ESDEGER DH (standart) =====================
  A_i = Rz(theta_i + off_i) Tz(d_i) Tx(a_i) Rx(alpha_i),  base_link_T_tool0 = A1 A2 ... A6  (sabit base/tool donusumu yok)

     i | off_i  | d_i [m]  | a_i [m]  | alpha_i
     1 |   0    |  0.1313  |  0       |  -pi/2
     2 | -pi/2  |  0       |  0.22995 |   0
     3 | +pi/2  |  0.0652  |  0       |  +pi/2
     4 |   0    |  0.22995 |  0       |  -pi/2
     5 |   0    | -0.0660  |  0       |  +pi/2
     6 |   0    |  0.20093 |  0       |   0
  URDF q_i = DH theta_i (offset'ler DH tablosunda). Dogrulama: 200 rastgele q icin URDF FK == DH FK (< 1e-9).

  Geometrik sinif: R ⊢ R ∥ R (articulated); d5 kacikligi nedeniyle bilek kuresel degil.
  ===============================================================
-->
<robot name="rk6">
